sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Client
  participant API
  participant Cache
  participant DB as Primary DB
  Client->>API: GET /resource/:id
  API->>Cache: Read resource key
  alt cache hit
    Cache-->>API: Cached projection
  else cache miss
    API->>DB: Read source of truth
    DB-->>API: Canonical row
    API->>Cache: Store projection with TTL
  end
  API-->>Client: Resource response
